OL,3,GNEWSACharging battery believed to have
OL,4,Acaused house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA house fire in Leicestershire is
OL,7,Fbelieved to have been caused by a
OL,8,Fcharging lithium-ion battery,
OL,9,Ffirefighters have said.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,F(LFRS) said crews were called to
OL,13,Freports of the blaze in North Street,
OL,14,FAshby-de-la-Zouch, shortly after 15:00
OL,15,FBST on Saturday.
OL,17,FThe fire, which is thought to have
OL,18,Fstarted following an electrical fault
OL,19,Finvolving a battery, caused extensive
OL,20,Fdamage to the property, particularly in
OL,21,Fthe kitchen where it had been left
OL,22,Fcharging.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
