OL,3,GNEWSACharging battery believed to have
OL,4,Acaused house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe service said four firefighters
OL,7,Fwearing breathing apparatus were
OL,8,Fdeployed to extinguish the blaze, but
OL,9,Fthe occupant managed to safely evacuate
OL,10,Fthe house.
